{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-22T15:24:04.264Z","data":{"text":"Implemented the doctor change checks and fixed the prior mutation gap.\n\n**What changed**\n- `crates/features/doctor/src/doctor/changes.rs`: new storage-backed locks/archives/done-markers checks, including worktree and stacked-folder listing and Node-style relative paths.\n- `crates/features/doctor/src/doctor.rs`: config/pi lines now return the used config, then the three change lines are always appended.\n- `crates/features/doctor/Cargo.toml` + `Cargo.lock`: added `osq-kernel-storage` and `osq-kernel-vcs`.\n- `doctor_checks.rs`: every fake-pi row now ends with the three healthy lines.\n- `doctor_changes.rs`: new tests for all change-line rows, the worktree scenario, and a stacked-folder case that kills the previously missed `stacked_folders` mutants.\n\n**Verification**\n- Task verify: passed.\n- Proposal verify with `OSQ_CHANGE=...`: passed.\n- `cargo mutants` over `doctor.rs` and `changes.rs`: all mutants caught.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/288-rust-doctor-changes/.run/results/2.md`."}}
